 Toilet heads, The Amazing Digital Circus (Pomni), Grimace Shake, Siren Head.\n- By embedding viral keywords in metadata and custom 3D peds, channels hijack recommendation velocity across multiple global search clusters simultaneously.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Requirement R5: The Active Creator Ecosystem, Toolchains & Underground Workflows\n\n### 5.1 The Complete Technical Production Toolchain\n\n```\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                            GTA V MOD ENGINE CORE                                  |\n|  +---------------------+   +---------------------+   +-------------------------+  |\n|  |   Grand Theft Auto  |   |    Script Hook V    |   |  ScriptHookVDotNet v3   |  |\n|  |   V (PC Clean Copy) |-->|   (Alexander Blade) |-->|  (C# Script Execution)  |  |\n|  +---------------------+   +---------------------+   +-------------------------+  |\n|             |                                                                     |\n|             v                                                                     |\n|  +---------------------+   +---------------------+   +-------------------------+  |\n|  |     OpenIV 4.1+     |   | Custom Gameconfig   |   | Limit Adjusters         |  |\n|  |  (RPF Archive Mod)  |-->| (Memory/Pool Fix)   |-->| (Heap & Packfile Limit) |  |\n|  +---------------------+   +---------------------+   +-------------------------+  |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n                                      |\n                                      v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                            INGAME CREATION SUITE                                  |\n|  +-----------------------------------+   +-------------------------------------+  |\n|  |          Menyoo PC 2.0+           |   |           AddonPeds 3.0.1           |  |\n|  | - Object Spooner (XML Map Loader) |   